                "message": "✨ feat: normalise key=value author names and misplaced prefixes in the BibTeX lint\n\nA new lint operation, sp-bibtex-lint-fix-prefixes, with a dry run in the\nreport and a button.\n\n- reads names an old Zotero export wrote as family=/given=/prefix=/suffix=/\n  useprefix= text and writes them as \"von Hayek, Friedrich A.\"\n- merges repeated given= parts and keeps the fullest one\n- moves particles that stand after the last name in front of it\n- reports names it cannot read and leaves them alone\n- batches of 50 with apply, global, skip, drop, bring back and quit; `g`\n  also works in the author-name fix\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAEq4doRNBiY7vseha",
